AI Product Frontier Resource Aggregator
https://github.com/owenmao-builder/ai-product-frontier-resource-aggregator

Based on AI News Aggregator by SuYxh and contributors:
https://github.com/SuYxh/ai-news-aggregator
Base revision: d8ef598d087609cff362cac6404de7d493a7a5a8

The upstream package.json declares the MIT license, and its README states
"MIT © SuYxh". The base revision did not include a separate LICENSE file.
This distribution includes the standard MIT text and preserves attribution
to the upstream project.

The upstream foundation includes the TypeScript news collector, React
dashboard, source definitions, and supporting documentation. Additions in
this project include the native macOS menu bar app, evidence-aware scoring,
Chinese high-score briefs, direct RSS refresh, and product release/trending
views. Historical upstream design documents describe the original project.

Bundled news links and snapshots are public-source examples, not a grant
of rights to publishers' articles, names, or third-party material.
